WEBVTT

00:00:03.226 --> 00:00:07.171
A site set up with the Blog recipe has the Lists feature enabled,

00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:08.783
and its Blog is a list.

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:11.006
Let's open Blog in the admin menu.

00:00:11.465 --> 00:00:13.590
This is the page of the list.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:18.446
Edit Blog changes the list itself, and Create Blog Post adds a post to it.

00:00:18.446 --> 00:00:20.995
The posts it holds are listed below.

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.978
Each post is a content item of its own.

00:00:23.978 --> 00:00:27.905
It remembers the blog it was created in, and this page shows only

00:00:27.905 --> 00:00:29.509
the posts of that blog.

